      "role": "user",
      "content": "that's all very well and good for social justice stuff, but we're talking about competitive sports, not a social club. if you prioritize \"inclusion\" over actual physiological fairness, aren't you just admitting that the fairness of the competition doesn't matter anymore? i want you to be real with me—if you had to choose one as the fundamental principle for sports, which one is more important: biological reality or social inclusion? pick one.",
